# Openagri drone runtime

## Linux dependencies:
sudo apt install libexif12 libgphoto2-6 libgphoto2-port12 libltdl7 libpq-dev gphoto2

## DNS names

Add following entries to the /etc/hosts file:

```
192.168.50.1    ilvonuc.com
192.168.50.1    postgres.ilvonuc.com
127.0.1.1       api.minio.ilvoraspi.com
```